{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/corner2.gif?t=1745201414\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/text18.png?t=1745201414\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a captivating grid-based combat system where you lead the Guardians in a battle to reclaim stolen artifacts from enemy forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/text19.png?t=1745201414\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategically manage a diverse roster of units, each with unique strengths and abilities, from agile scouts to powerful heavy hitters, ensuring every battle feels fresh and dynamic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/units.gif?t=1745201414\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/text20.png?t=1745201414\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different terrains modify buffs and debuffs, enhancing strategic gameplay and requiring you to adapt your tactics for maximum advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/snowLava.gif?t=1745201414\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/text21.png?t=1745201414\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a vibrant 2D + 3D art style that combines playful character designs with richly detailed environments, creating an engaging visual experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/seezor_02.gif?t=1745201414\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/text17.png?t=1745201414\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a story-driven single-player campaign filled with challenging missions and an intriguing narrative that unfolds as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/sixcharacters.gif?t=1745201414\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/text16.png?t=1745201414\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own maps using the built-in level editor, allowing for endless creativity and unique gameplay experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/CapCut24.gif?t=1745201414\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3266580?t=1745201414","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/d49f0aabac1b980b5616ca96df12dd730617c442/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745201414","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/0f005cba70d79a8aa1b57f6de3ef1a1c61db0eca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745201414","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/0f005cba70d79a8aa1b57f6de3ef1a1c61db0eca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745201414","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"cont